      "writtenOn": "2025-10-19T14:30:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Bazel does not use env vars for configuring its behavior, all options are exposed as command-line flags.\n\nI don\u0027t remember, why are we sometimes using flags, but sometimes env vars for configuring Siso? Could we just make everything a flag (e.g. `-limits` instead of `SISO_LIMITS\u003d`?)",
